A '''glassblowing pipe''' is a tool used to make items from [[molten glass]] using the [[Crafting]] skill. It is required to make glass items. The item can be obtained from [[Fritz the Glassblower]]'s house found in the south-western area of [[Entrana]], taken from a [[tool store 3]] in a [[player-owned house]] (required 35 [[Construction]]), from [[Grandpa Jack]]'s house (from [[Fishing Contest]] quest), bought from the [[Piscatoris Fishing Colony]] after finishing [[Swan Song]], or bought from [[charter ship]] locations (from the crew).

